{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/12077","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"DS785 .S8","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"12077","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Innermost Asia: detailed report of explorations in Central Asia, Kan-su and eastern Iran, carried out and described under the orders of H.M. Indian government ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Stein, Aurel,","id":"actor/stein-aurel","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Clarendon Press","id":"actor/clarendon-press","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1928","begin_of_the_begin":"1928-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1928-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Page marker found between pp. 22-23.\nEphemera found between pp. 788-789 : Newspaper clipping : On the Trail of Ancient Civilizations in Central Asia by Henry E. Armstrong, New York Times book review, June 18, 1933.\nEphemera found in bottom of portfolio : Flyer : Scrutiny, v. 2, no. 4, March 1934.\nEphemera found on shelf, inventory notes item as being 'inside front cover', but does not indicate which v. : Newspaper clipping : Inmost Asia, New York Times literary supplement, November 19, 1931.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nFor the geographical investigations which were intended to play a large and important part in my travels, most effective help from the Survey of India was assured to me.--Introd., p. viii.\nList of abbreviated titles: v. 1, p. [xxiii]-xxvi.\nVols. I-II paged continuously.\nWith descriptive lists of antiques by F.H. Andrews and F.M.G. Lorimer; and appendices by J. Allan, F. Benveniste, A.H. Francke, L. Giles, R.L. Hobson, T.A. Joyce, S. Konow, A. von Le Coq, W. Lentz, S. Levi, H. Maspero, F.E. Pargiter, R. Smith, W.J. Sollas, R.C. Spiller, F.W. Thomas, V. Thomsen.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq v. 1 : fair condition.|abq v. 2, v. 3 : poor condition.|abq v. 4 : fair condition ; some maps cannot unfold ; portfolio : poor condition.|SColl abq v. 1 - v. 3 : Embossed stamp on front loose endpaper : Georgia O'Keeffe / Abiquiu, New Mexico.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}